{"id":"conv_04094","context":"A retired elder and a teacher discuss community history","ambient":"cafe_quiet_chatter","cast":["hiroshi_elder","asuka_teacher"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Hiroshi-san, I heard you've lived in this village a long time. Could you tell me about the old days?","jp":"広志さん、この村に長くご在住だと伺いました。昔の様子を教えていただけますか。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,5,8,9,14,16,21,28,31,50,127,665,889,1146,1189,1734,2693,3077,3330,3813,4781,5964,7885,11758],"jpTokens":[{"s":"広志","r":"ひろし"},{"s":"さん","w":50},{"s":"、"},{"s":"この","w":31},{"s":"村","r":"むら","w":1189},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"長く","r":"ながく","w":889},{"s":"ご","w":127},{"s":"在住","r":"ざいじゅう","w":3813},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"伺い","r":"うかがい","w":11758},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"},{"s":"昔","r":"むかし","w":665},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"様子","r":"ようす","w":1146},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"教え","r":"おしえ","w":3330},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"いただけ","w":3077},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Yes, right after the war, most people were farmers, and everyone lived helping each other.","jp":"ええ、戦後すぐの頃はね、ほとんどが農民で、皆が助け合って暮らしておったんですよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,6,7,8,17,26,68,361,369,411,440,1390,2136,2316,2617,3039,3997,5438,5879,8106,9497],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"、"},{"s":"戦後","r":"せんご","w":2136},{"s":"すぐ","w":440},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"頃","r":"ころ","w":411},{"s":"はね","w":5879},{"s":"、"},{"s":"ほとんど","w":369},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"農民","r":"のうみん","w":3997},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"、"},{"s":"皆","r":"みな","w":1390},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"助け合っ","r":"たすけあっ"},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"暮らし","r":"くらし","w":5438},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"おっ","w":361},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"The records show there was also a branch of the agricultural cooperative in this district.","jp":"農協の支部も、この地区にあったと記録に残って